 dana:{title:'Dana has a good reason to believe in AI.',quote:'“We bought Copilot for everyone. I use Claude myself.”',situation:'Claude helps her think through the board’s hardest questions.',consequence:'Her experience is real. It does not show how everyone else works.',action:'Open Claude preparation',done:'A better question for the board',max:1},
 daniel:{title:'Daniel delivered a useful company assistant.',quote:'“We launched an assistant. We’re waiting for feedback.”',situation:'Ask Parkside finds the approved procedure and its source.',consequence:'IT sees activity. Employee feedback would reveal which tasks improve and where people get stuck.',action:'Ask how to escalate a client issue',done:'Show the launch and feedback',max:2},
 ben:{title:'Ben built a better forecast review.',quote:'“I figured out a better way to review our forecast.”',situation:'He saves four weekly snapshots and checks date changes against buyer activity.',consequence:'Leadership receives the revised forecast. His review method stays in his workbook.',action:'Run saved forecast review',done:'Three deals need a closer look',max:1,peer:'A new sales manager exports the same pipeline. She compares this week’s totals manually and has not noticed the repeated date changes.',peerTitle:'Another manager starts from scratch',peerTool:'HubSpot export → manual review'},
