 elena:{title:'Elena wants to use AI. She needs a practical way in.',quote:'“I want to use it. I don’t know where to start.”',situation:'She tried a broad prompt while a real deadline was approaching.',consequence:'She returned to manual updates. A guided review of her actual notes and tracker would give her a useful starting point.',action:'Open her first attempt',done:'Return to the Thursday deadline',max:2},
